\" width=618 height=314 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING</h2>Collect materials and craft an arsenal of powerful weapons, armors and much more to defend yourself against the undead.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072270/extras/316260d1891f65ca0c05a307a13eec40.avif?t=1724274972\" width=618 height=314 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE ANTI-VIRUS</h2>Embark on a critical mission to find the anti-virus and save humanity from extinction. Time is running out, and your actions will determine the fate of the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072270/extras/b2df7560277d85a9e9d5f965bc478c4b.avif?t=1724274972\" width=618 height=314 /></span>",
